Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.43,0:00:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我从护理学校毕业后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,去上班的第一个医院
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有传言说护士频繁更换
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Moodyz 呈献
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,导演 GORY松田
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.33,0:00:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,工作并不是特别繁重
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,医生和病人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,也都没什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有抱怨医院的护士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一天一天的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,护士越来越少
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,也一直在补充新护士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,护士马上辞职的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.96,0:01:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我来到了这样的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.53,0:01:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,护士马上辞职的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,遇到了温柔的前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.04,0:01:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我感觉我的护士生活会很充实
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.96,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.73,0:01:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,事件已经发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.35,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,护士马上辞职的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那是两位护士前辈值夜班的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.80,0:02:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,护士马上辞职的医院
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,以那天的夜班为界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,护士前辈们突然消失不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.20,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,到了我上夜班的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,触手病房
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.87,0:02:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次上班\N（事件发生前三天）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.59,0:03:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.30,0:03:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是今天来上班的二宫沙树 请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.43,0:03:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请多关照\N- 请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.83,0:03:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.97,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办\N- 哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.63,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.89,0:03:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,二宫在其他医院做过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚从护理学校毕业就来这里上班了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,和我们一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.53,0:03:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我也才来了一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是这样啊\N- 我是三个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.49,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不过这家医院
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,明明不是很忙 但是经常换护士呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 换得非常频繁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,完全不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.26,0:04:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,既然二宫来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,该结束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,前几天 我几乎被逼着一起工作
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,因为啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.63,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,后天要上夜班吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人愿意上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.94,0:04:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.53,0:04:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,既然二宫来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你能上夜班吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,后跟...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,二宫来了 真是帮了大忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 两个人都很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.88,0:05:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,但愿不要马上被换掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.96,0:05:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不奇怪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 可以  没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,二宫你也得抓紧时间 不然早会就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.35,0:05:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,今天要讲什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了 我要擦身体了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.76,0:05:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不冷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.70,0:05:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不能洗澡很难受吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1386,716)}二宫沙树\N刚从护理学校毕业的\N新人护士
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.56,0:05:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,会变得很干净的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请全部抬起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这个姿势辛苦吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也要擦一下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.23,0:06:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 不好意思 我们坐轮椅去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,请抓住我的肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我说预备就要起来了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.60,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,请当心哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.53,0:06:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那么先把脚放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.56,0:06:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 请放下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1534,914)}夏目优希\N与华丽的外表相反\N对工作认真的骨干护士
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.86,0:06:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有哪里感觉痛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.93,0:06:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,到后面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,走了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1488,910)}篠田优\N沉稳的性格\N有点粗心的骨干护士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伤口恢复的怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,比前几天好很多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,已经好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,照这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就能痊愈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.06,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那把床倒下了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,盖上被子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静地休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.44,0:07:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,事件发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.22,0:08:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,事件发生\N(上夜班时 凌晨3点)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.04,0:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,（护士站）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,优希睡着了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.40,0:08:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,下次去女子会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不错啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.54,0:09:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,最近都没有约会 很累呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.91,0:09:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.79,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都在工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.32,0:09:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,已经三点了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.19,0:09:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好困
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很困吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,明天上白班
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.10,0:09:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,先小睡一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,下次休息什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.71,0:09:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,后天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.07,0:09:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们一起啊\N- 一起?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,下次休息的时候去女子会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.75,0:09:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,邀请谁呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.25,0:09:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,邀请谁来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小牧医生怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.16,0:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,医院以外也有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是讨厌吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.43,0:09:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多到巡视的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.10,0:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你不去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那就猜拳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,最初是石头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.48,0:10:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,石头剪刀布
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.40,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托你了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.79,0:10:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很讨厌深夜去巡视呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很恐怖的 要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.10,0:10:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,女子会说好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.00,0:10:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 慢走\N- 我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.20,0:10:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.73,0:10:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这个月的排班
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,二宫也应该加进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好的好的 我来做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.42,0:10:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 慢走\N- 我去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,今天这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.36,0:11:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,用过了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,可能用过这个房间
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来过这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,开着灯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.16,0:12:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,开关呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.49,0:14:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.56,0:14:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.14,0:14:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.60,0:15:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.36,0:15:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.33,0:17:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,停下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.66,0:17:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
